createdby: DBot
description: 'Returns the access control list (ACL) of an Amazon S3 bucket in a specified
  AWS account and region. Shows the grants that define who has access to the bucket
  and what permissions they have. Use this action to investigate cloud posture issues
  related to S3 bucket ACLs such as public access grants to AllUsers or AuthenticatedUsers
  groups, or overly permissive bucket-level permissions. REQUIRES: `account_id`, `region`,
  and the resource identifier. When these are not present in user input, resolve them
  first via `CortexListAssets` using the issue''s asset_id or asset_name.'
